Error [E0202]: Cannot take a write window into `xs`
  --> write_window_requires_mutable_owner_or_write_parameter.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |     edit :: &xs[0]
    |             ^^^^^^
 Why: A write window can change its owner, so the owner must be mutable
 Fix: Declare `xs := ...`
